---
/**
 * @category Testimonials
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Testimonials2
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-16'>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-10'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:col-span-7 md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>What changed after the switch</h2>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:col-span-5 dark:text-stone-400'>Studios, freelancers and in-house teams on moving their sites into plain Astro files they can edit on a canvas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-x-10 xl:gap-x-16'>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-10'>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-6 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-2xl leading-snug tracking-[-0.02em] text-stone-900 text-pretty md:text-[1.75rem] dark:text-stone-50'>“We hand clients the canvas and keep the repo. They change their own opening hours and menus, and nothing they touch can break the build.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic01.webp' alt='Portrait of Priya Raman' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Priya Raman</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Founder, Kettle Studio</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-6 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“Dark mode took one afternoon. Every color in the file already had its dark variant.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic02.webp' alt='Portrait of Jonas Weber' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Jonas Weber</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Freelance developer</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-6 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“I imported our old Astro theme expecting a mess. It came in as MDX pages with Tailwind, and the components we had written by hand still worked.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic03.webp' alt='Portrait of Ana Ortega' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Ana Ortega</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Front-end lead, Corvo Dental</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-10'>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-6 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“Our writers fix typos on the real page now, not in a form that looks nothing like it.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic04.webp' alt='Portrait of Mei Lin Zhou' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Mei Lin Zhou</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Content lead, Paper Harbor</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-6 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“We deploy from our own Vercel account. If we ever left Starquix, the site would keep building from the same files.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic14.webp' alt='Portrait of Kofi Mensah' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Kofi Mensah</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Engineering manager, Tidewater Books</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class='m-0 flex flex-col gap-6 border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 pt-6 dark:border-stone-700'>
          <blockquote class='m-0'>
            <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-900 text-pretty dark:text-stone-50'>“Breakpoints are why I stayed. I set the mobile layout on the canvas, open the file in my code editor, and the md: classes sit exactly where I would have put them. No export step, no generated markup to clean up.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption class='flex items-center gap-3'>
            <img class='block h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover' src='/assets/userpics/userpic11.webp' alt='Portrait of Hanna Sörensen' width='40' height='40' />
            <div class='flex flex-col'>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Hanna Sörensen</p>
              <p class='m-0 font-sans text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400'>Product designer, Nordvik Outdoor</p>
            </div>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
